  Which tier      : docs/design/TIERING_PLAN_2026-09-03.md
  Why the split   : docs/design/LICENSING_MODEL_2026-09-04.md

NOTE (2026-09-04): the Correlix Enterprise License text has not been drafted
yet. Until it exists, the identifier above resolves to no terms, no licence is
granted over this directory, and all rights are reserved to Correlix. The
release gate refuses to ship in this state.
